 "Published data agree on a few patterns: short subject lines (2–4 words, Belkins), relevant personalization (Belkins: 7% vs 3% reply), simple language (Boomerang), and a low-friction interest CTA for strangers (Gong). Plain text, one ask, written for one person.",
